he web, read live or from a web-archive capture of the page, NOT the signed or officially printed original; a lead to the original and to the text, never the original by itself"}],"savings_leads":[],"whole_order_end":[{"custody_records_in":["later-events"],"group":{"actor":"EO:13062","corroborated_by_two_jobs":false,"date":"1997-09-29","jobs":["later-events"]},"meta":{"acting_instrument_id":"EO:13062","date_basis":["acting order signing_date from OFR catalog","date stated next to the acting instrument in the OFR note"],"evidence_types":["ofr_note_on_acting","ofr_note_on_target"],"from":"later-events@jobs/later-events/output","from_job":"later-events","ids":["LE-41c7c40dbb79","LE-5cb6b69f63e5"],"quote":"EO 13015, August 22, 1996","quote_kind":"verbatim_note_item","quote_truncated":false,"status":"CANDIDATE_UNVERIFIED"},"proposal":{"actor":"EO:13062","date":"1997-09-29","mechanism":"revocation","source":{"page_or_item":"OFR API record executive_order_number=13062; citation 62 FR 51755; document_number 97-26364; field disposition_notes","sha256":"8ba9e1cce593bb06b6be625b585b15bb04a1555ed34ad8c5b6f8c9bd81f83f77","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/documents?conditions%5Bcorrection%5D=0&conditions%5Bpresidential_document_type%5D=executive_order&conditions%5Btype%5D%5B%5D=PRESDOCU&fields%5B%5D=citation&fields%5B%5D=disposition_notes&fields%5B%5D=document_number&fields%5B%5D=executive_order_number&fields%5B%5D=html_url&fields%5B%5D=pdf_url&fields%5B%5D=president&fields%5B%5D=publication_date&fields%5B%5D=raw_text_url&fields%5B%5D=signing_date&fields%5B%5D=title&format=json&include_pre_1994_docs=true&order=executive_order_number&page=6&per_page=1000&search_after_cursor=WzEyNDk3LjAsIjEyNDk3Il0"}},"suggested":true}],"whole_order_end_total":1},"provisional_status":"no","readiness":{"by_step":{"clause_inventory":"confirm","counterevidence":"confirm","ending_or_current_basis":"confirm","opus_media":"n/a","original_text":"done_now_by_custody","savings_residuals":"agent_judgment","shared_sources":"n/a"},"needs_research":[],"would_satisfy_once_confirmed":["clause_inventory","ending_or_current_basis","counterevidence"]},"shared_sources":[],"signing_dates_seen":{"fr-originals@jobs/fr-originals/output":"1996-08-22","later-events_catalog":"1996-08-22","research/stage21/original_sources/CASE_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_CUSTODY.csv":"1996-08-22","stage19_causal_queue":"1996-08-22","stage21_crosswalk":"1996-08-22"},"source_ladder_exhausted_proposed":[],"status":"MACHINE DRAFT - UNVERIFIED; not a claim; see jobs/claim-drafts/AGENT_GUIDE.md"},"claim":{"instrument_id":"EO:13015","later_source_search":[],"operative_clauses":[{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Section 1. Establishment. There is established the White House Commission\non Aviation Safety and Security (the ‘‘Commission’’). The Commission shall\nconsist of not more than 25 members, to be appointed by the President\nfrom the public and private sectors, each of whom shall have experience\nor expertise in some aspect of aviation safety or security. The Vice President\nshall serve as the Chair of the Commission.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"61 FR 43937, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 1","sha256":"97a82500cc9b60e15895217105dc58d2530ab4b24754ed7037aebc875abb6640","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-08-27/pdf/96-21996.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13015#sec1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) The Commission shall advise the President on matters\ninvolving aviation safety and security, including air traffic control.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"61 FR 43937, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 2(a)","sha256":"97a82500cc9b60e15895217105dc58d2530ab4b24754ed7037aebc875abb6640","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-08-27/pdf/96-21996.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13015#sec2(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) The Commission shall develop and recommend to the President a\nstrategy designed to improve aviation safety and security, both domestically\nand internationally.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"61 FR 43937, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 2(b)","sha256":"97a82500cc9b60e15895217105dc58d2530ab4b24754ed7037aebc875abb6640","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-08-27/pdf/96-21996.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13015#sec2(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) The Chair may, from time to time, invite experts to submit information\nto the Commission; hold hearings on relevant issues; and form committees\nand teams to assist the Commission in accomplishing its objectives and\nduties, which may include individuals other than members of the Commis-\nsion.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"61 FR 43937, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 2(c)","sha256":"97a82500cc9b60e15895217105dc58d2530ab4b24754ed7037aebc875abb6640","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-08-27/pdf/96-21996.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13015#sec2(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) The heads of executive departments and agencies\nshall, to the extent permitted by law, provide the Commission such informa-\ntion with respect to aviation safety and security as the Commission requires\nto fulfill its functions.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"61 FR 43937, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 3(a)","sha256":"97a82500cc9b60e15895217105dc58d2530ab4b24754ed7037aebc875abb6640","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-08-27/pdf/96-21996.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13015#sec3(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) The Commission shall be supported, both administratively and finan-\ncially, by the Department of Transportation and such other sources (including\nother Federal agencies) as may lawfully contribute to Commission activities.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"61 FR 43937, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 3(b)","sha256":"97a82500cc9b60e15895217105dc58d2530ab4b24754ed7037aebc875abb6640","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-08-27/pdf/96-21996.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13015#sec3(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) I have determined that the Commission shall be estab-\nlished in compliance with the Federal Advisory Committee Act, as amended\n(5 U.S.C. App. 2). Notwithstanding any other Executive order, the functions\nof the President under the Federal Advisory Committee Act, as amended,\nshall be performed by the Secretary of Transportation in accordance with\nthe guidelines and procedures established by the Administrator of General\nServices, except that of reporting to the Congress.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"61 FR 43937, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 4(a)","sha256":"97a82500cc9b60e15895217105dc58d2530ab4b24754ed7037aebc875abb6640","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-08-27/pdf/96-21996.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13015#sec4(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) The Commission shall exist for a period of 6 months from the date\nof this order, unless extended by the President.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"61 FR 43937, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 4(b)","sha256":"97a82500cc9b60e15895217105dc58d2530ab4b24754ed7037aebc875abb6640","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-08-27/pdf/96-21996.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13015#sec4(b)","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"whole per-document Federal Register PDF (61 FR 43937)","sha256":"97a82500cc9b60e15895217105dc58d2530ab4b24754ed7037aebc875abb6640","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-08-27/pdf/96-21996.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 8 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: whole-order ending not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not closed","DRAFT: later_source_search not recorded (machine searches are proposals only; paste them after judging them adequate and resolving every CONFLICT line)"],"whole_order_end":null,"whole_order_status":"no"},"draft_schema":"eo-claim-draft/v1","instrument_id":"EO:13015"}
